  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/05edd8fa-e7b0-4611-9103-1f7964271741-WhatsAppImage2022-01-25at8.47.52PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 213px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> is orthocentre and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math> is centroid and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is circumcentre. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math> divides <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> ratio.<br />Position vector of centriod <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>G</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />Position vector of circum center <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />Apply Section Formula,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>G</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>G</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>G</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">=</mi><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
